Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.69,0:02:05.73,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Você é meu pequeno companheiro
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.73,0:02:10.28,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Ei, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.98,0:02:10.94,OP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Bubee, bubee, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:13.61,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Meu coração está acelerado
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:16.24,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}O que se reflete nesses olhos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:19.03,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}São as cores de um novo mundo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:20.54,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Woah
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.58,0:02:24.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Fique ao meu lado hoje também
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:27.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Vamos seguir enquanto seguro sua mão
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.21,0:02:31.00,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Anseio por um lugar onde eu possa brilhar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.59,0:02:37.01,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Enquanto um som mágico ecoa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.84,0:02:40.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Eu quero cantar com você
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:42.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Vamos cantar juntos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:46.31,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Você é uma estrela que brilha intensamente
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.31,0:02:47.98,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Meu bubee, bubee, bubee love
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.86,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Podemos ser estrelas brilhantes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:52.61,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}Mesmo com o tempo passando,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.61,0:02:55.36,OP,,0,0,0,,{\c&HE52FD3&\bord6\blur10\fad(150,150)}é uma magia secreta
